# The repo ignores lockfiles globally (line 8), but the frontend build needs a committed
# lockfile: CI does `checkout` then `docker build`, and `npm ci` has no lockfile otherwise.
# Pinning it also keeps the shipped static bundle reproducible.
!frontend/package-lock.json
